<title>USA: First of Long Island sets shr buyback plan.</title>
<headline>First of Long Island sets shr buyback plan.</headline>
<dateline>GLEN HEAD, N.Y. 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>First of Long Island Corp said Friday it has set an additional stock buyback plan, and plans to repurchase up to 20,000 shares of common stock.</p>
<p>Previously announced programs remain in effect, of which there are 8,603 shares still available to be repurchased.</p>
<p>The shares are to be repurchased in the marketplace or in private transactions.</p>
<p>The authorization represents about one percent of the company's 2,084,366 shares outstanding as of June 30. The stock purchases are to be financed through available cash.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
